      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，在赛前特别节目中，集合了『日本杯』\n的出走者，而高尚骏逸也坐在其中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ea9e6635a0425d3ab0410751c60baf2aae7a866fe07f15ec63996d28286431",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
