      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这也让里见皇冠、北部玄驹等同期劲敌们\n更受刺激，纷纷为『日本德比』投入更多热情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "730558824a560d90bffcbbead86f0191ef8d6cefe4662b29c0ffbe9bc4c882b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
